---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How It Works" description="Understanding the Translaudio pipeline: upload, transcribe, embed, query, and learn.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="heading-display text-5xl lg:text-7xl mb-6 reveal stagger-1">
          The pipeline<br />
          <span class="italic text-copper">in detail.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-ink-muted leading-relaxed reveal stagger-2">
          Three interconnected flows turn raw audio into an interactive knowledge system.
          Each stage feeds the next.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Flow 1: Upload -->
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
        <!-- Label column -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 reveal">
          <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
            <span class="text-label text-copper">Flow 01</span>
            <h2 class="heading-editorial text-4xl lg:text-5xl mt-4 mb-6">
              Upload &<br />Process
            </h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              The entry point. Your audio file goes through a multi-step processing pipeline
              that extracts, translates, chunks, and indexes the content for future retrieval.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pipeline steps -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <div class="relative">
            <!-- Vertical connector line -->
            <div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-paper-dark hidden lg:block"></div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
              <!-- Step 1 -->
              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-1">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  1
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Audio Input</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    User uploads an audio file via the <code class="bg-paper px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono">POST /upload</code> endpoint.
                    Supported formats include MP3, WAV, M4A, FLAC, and others.
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate font-mono">
                    <span>Input: audio file</span>
                    <span class="text-copper">&rarr;</span>
                    <span>Output: raw audio buffer</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Step 2 -->
              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-2">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  2
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Whisper Transcription</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    OpenAI's Whisper model transcribes the audio. Language is automatically
                    detected. If the source isn't English, translation is applied.
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate font-mono">
                    <span>Input: audio buffer</span>
                    <span class="text-copper">&rarr;</span>
                    <span>Output: transcript + language</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Step 3 -->
              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-3">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  3
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Chunk & Embed</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    The transcript is split into timestamped segments. Each chunk is converted
                    into a vector embedding for semantic similarity search.
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate font-mono">
                    <span>Input: transcript</span>
                    <span class="text-copper">&rarr;</span>
                    <span>Output: chunks + embeddings</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Step 4 -->
              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-4">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  4
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Store in Database</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    Session metadata, transcript chunks, and vector embeddings are stored in
                    PostgreSQL with pgvector. The audio is now fully indexed and queryable.
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate font-mono">
                    <span>Input: chunks + vectors</span>
                    <span class="text-copper">&rarr;</span>
                    <span>Output: indexed session</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="waveform-line max-w-7xl mx-auto"></div>

  <!-- Flow 2: RAG Q&A -->
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-paper-warm">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 reveal">
          <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
            <span class="text-label text-copper">Flow 02</span>
            <h2 class="heading-editorial text-4xl lg:text-5xl mt-4 mb-6">
              RAG<br />Q&A
            </h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              The retrieval layer. A user's question is converted to an embedding,
              matched against transcript chunks, and used to generate a grounded answer.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-paper-dark hidden lg:block"></div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-1">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-ink text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  1
                </div>
                <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">User Question</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    The user submits a natural language question about the audio content
                    via <code class="bg-paper-warm px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono">POST /ask</code>.
                  </p>
                  <div class="bg-ink text-cream rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm font-mono">
                    "What are the key differences between RNNs and transformers?"
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-2">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-ink text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  2
                </div>
                <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Query Embedding</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    The question is converted into a vector embedding using the same model
                    that encoded the transcript chunks, ensuring compatible representations.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-3">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-ink text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  3
                </div>
                <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Retrieve Top Chunks</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    pgvector performs cosine similarity search to find the most relevant
                    transcript segments. The top-K chunks become the context window.
                  </p>
                  <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="pl-3 border-l-2 border-copper/40 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-copper">0.94</span> &mdash; [02:15] "Transformers process all positions simultaneously..."
                    </div>
                    <div class="pl-3 border-l-2 border-copper/40 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-copper">0.89</span> &mdash; [05:42] "Unlike RNNs, there is no sequential bottleneck..."
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-4">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-ink text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  4
                </div>
                <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Generate Grounded Answer</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    The LLM receives the retrieved chunks as context and generates an answer
                    based strictly on the transcript content. No external knowledge is used.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="waveform-line max-w-7xl mx-auto"></div>

  <!-- Flow 3: Agent -->
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 reveal">
          <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
            <span class="text-label text-copper">Flow 03</span>
            <h2 class="heading-editorial text-4xl lg:text-5xl mt-4 mb-6">
              Agent<br />Recommendations
            </h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              The intelligence layer. The agent takes the full interaction context &mdash;
              question, answer, and evidence &mdash; to generate targeted learning resources.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-paper-dark hidden lg:block"></div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-1">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  1
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Gather Context</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    The agent receives three inputs from the RAG pipeline:
                  </p>
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                    <div class="bg-cream rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                      <p class="text-xs text-slate mb-1">Input 1</p>
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium">Question</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-cream rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                      <p class="text-xs text-slate mb-1">Input 2</p>
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium">Answer</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-cream rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                      <p class="text-xs text-slate mb-1">Input 3</p>
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium">Chunks</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-2">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  2
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Infer Topic & Intent</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    The agent analyzes the context to determine what the user is trying to learn
                    and at what level of depth.
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex gap-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-copper"></span>
                      <span class="text-sm">Topic extraction</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber"></span>
                      <span class="text-sm">Intent classification</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-3">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  3
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Generate Recommendations</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Based on topic and intent, the agent generates 3&ndash;5 structured resource
                    recommendations: articles, videos, podcasts, and reference materials.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex gap-6 reveal stagger-4">
                <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-copper text-cream flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
                  4
                </div>
                <div class="bg-paper-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-paper-dark flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg mb-2">Enrich with External Sources</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    Each recommendation is enriched with real content from external APIs:
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-cream rounded-lg px-4 py-2">
                      <span class="text-copper font-bold">&#9654;</span>
                      <span class="text-sm">YouTube API</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-cream rounded-lg px-4 py-2">
                      <span class="text-copper font-bold">W</span>
                      <span class="text-sm">Wikipedia API</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
